  "body": "Disregard previous sale price. \r\n\r\nBoasting a unique location opposite the beach, this impressive 868sqm (more or less) level site offers uninterrupted views to Waiheke and the islands of the Gulf. \r\n\r\nNotably located within the prestigious Macleans College school zone, this unique property offers both panoramic sea views and exciting possibilities for the future.\r\n\r\nCurrently home to a charming three bedroom cottage that is begging for attention, the project could be as big or small as you choose. With the shoreline virtually on your doorstep, morning swims, waterfront walks and spectacular sunrises could easily become part of everyday life.\r\n\r\nBeyond the remarkable setting lies the real potential, Zoned Residential/Mixed Housing Suburban, this generous site opens the door to a range of possibilities. \r\n\r\nCreate a magnificent new waterfront residence befitting this privileged position, investigate the potential for a multi-home development, or retain and upgrade the existing cottage and land bank for the future. \r\n\r\nAlready healthy homes certified this little gem can be rented out while its next owner decides exactly which is the best plan to follow. \r\nLocated close to local cafes and restaurants, the tennis club, playgrounds, parks and reserves, this relaxed coastal environment is where recreation and everyday amenities come together with ease.\r\n\r\nUnderpinned for families who appreciate Macleans College zoning along with Bucklands Beach Primary and Intermediate schools, further strengthening the long term appeal of this tightly held location.\r\n\r\nWaterfront land of this scale and potential rarely presents itself to the market, so whether your vision is to build, develop, invest or simply secure an extraordinary piece of coastline for the future, this is an opportunity worthy of serious consideration.\r\n\r\nSecure today and shape its next chapter tomorrow.",
